{
  "id": 21,
  "name": "regret_dense",
  "intent": "Increases regret weight to 0.4 (vs seed 0.3) to more strongly prioritize high-regret candidates, reducing the chance that critical insertion points are missed later. Adds a small cluster_density bonus to mildly prefer candidates surrounded by many unvisited cities, supporting smoother future moves and denser local neighborhoods. Keeps distance as the dominant negative term so edge costs are not ignored. This explores a stronger regret response combined with a bounded centrality bias.",
